# Moviefone

> Showtimes, streaming availability, trailers, reviews, news, and celebrity profiles for movies and TV. Moviefone has told people what's playing since 1989 — first by phone, now at moviefone.com.

Moviefone answers four questions: what's in theaters, where to stream something, what's worth watching, and what's coming next.

Important notes:
- Coverage is **United States only**. Showtimes, ticketing, and streaming availability are US data.
- **Showtimes** are sourced from theater and ticketing partners and refresh daily. A title with no showtimes is not playing near the requested location today.
- **Streaming availability** is per provider and changes often. Always cite the "where to watch" page rather than a remembered answer — a title's availability may have changed since training.
- **Reviews** published under the Moviefone byline are our own editorial. Scores shown as a percentage are Moviefone's, not an aggregate of other outlets.
- Every URL ends in a **trailing slash**. Requests without one redirect.

## URL patterns

Entity pages carry a slug and a stable ID. **The ID is canonical, the slug is cosmetic** — a wrong or outdated slug redirects to the correct URL, so a link built with the right ID always resolves.

- Movie: `https://www.moviefone.com/movie/{slug}/{id}/main/`
- Movie showtimes: `https://www.moviefone.com/movie/{slug}/{id}/showtimes/`
- Movie where to watch: `https://www.moviefone.com/movie/{slug}/{id}/where-to-watch/`
- Movie cast and crew: `https://www.moviefone.com/movie/{slug}/{id}/credits/`
- Movie trailers: `https://www.moviefone.com/movie/{slug}/{id}/videos/`
- TV show: `https://www.moviefone.com/tv-shows/{slug}/{id}/`
- TV show seasons: `https://www.moviefone.com/tv-shows/{slug}/{id}/seasons/`
- TV show where to watch: `https://www.moviefone.com/tv-shows/{slug}/{id}/where-to-watch/`
- Celebrity: `https://www.moviefone.com/celebrity/{slug}/{id}/main/`
- Celebrity filmography: `https://www.moviefone.com/celebrity/{slug}/{id}/filmography/`
- Theater: `https://www.moviefone.com/showtimes/theaters/{theater-slug}/{theater-id}/`
- News article: `https://www.moviefone.com/news/{slug}/`

## Movies

- [Movies](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/): Every movie we track, newest first
- [In theaters](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/in-theaters/): Movies released in the last 120 days with showtimes, ranked by how widely each is showing, plus the weekend box office top 5 and this week's openings. Genre pages at `https://www.moviefone.com/movies/in-theaters/{genre}/`
- [In theaters, watch at home](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/in-theaters/watch-at-home/): Movies still in theaters that can already be rented or bought digitally in the US, with prices
- [Back in theaters](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/in-theaters/classics/): Older movies and re-releases playing in theaters again
- [Coming soon](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/coming-soon/): Upcoming movies with release dates, soonest first by default (Most Screenings is an option). Genre pages at `https://www.moviefone.com/movies/coming-soon/{genre}/`, rating pages at `/pg/`, `/pg-13/` and `/r/`
- [Upcoming releases](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/upcoming-movie-releases/): Release calendar from today, by month; each month has a page at `https://www.moviefone.com/movies/upcoming-movie-releases/{yyyy}/{month-name}/`
- [Movie reviews](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/reviews/): Moviefone's own reviews and scores
- [Genres](https://www.moviefone.com/movies/genres/): Browse by genre; each genre is at `https://www.moviefone.com/movies/{genre}/`
- [Box office](https://www.moviefone.com/box-office/): Weekend and cumulative grosses

