## Not useful to crawl

- `https://www.moviefone.com/api/` — internal JSON endpoints for the site's own front end
- `https://www.moviefone.com/search/` — search result pages, generated per query
- Any URL with `?sort=`, `?page=`, or `?utm_` — filtered or duplicated views of the hubs above
